{"CLs":[{"__type":"ST","Var":"Info_General"}],"CMT":"This system is used to store every watched alarms in a data base.\u000d\u000a\u000d\u000aAn alarm is composed of two text, a \"Group\" and a \"Message\". Both of theses values will be converted in an Id by the\u000d\u000amanager with tables in \"General\" database.\u000d\u000a\u000d\u000aEvery alams have two internal time:\u000d\u000a- The delay to have an operator intervention.\u000d\u000a- The delay to restart the machine.","LRI":1,"RRI":2,"VLs":[]}
{"CLs":[{"__type":"ST","Var":"Info_Global"}],"CMT":"The manager need a global variable \"HistoAlarm\" as \"OBJ\\HISTOALARM\".","LRI":1,"RRI":2,"VLs":[]}
{"CLs":[{"__type":"LD","Var":"P_On"},{"__type":"FB","In":[{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"MyDB","IO":true,"Ix":1,"Type":"OBJ\\DB\\BASE","Var":"DB_Machine"},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"MyDB_General","IO":true,"Ix":2,"Type":"OBJ\\DB\\BASE","Var":"DB_General"},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"Id_WorkOrder","Ix":3,"Type":"DINT","Var":""},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"Id_Product","Ix":4,"Type":"DINT","Var":""},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"Id_Machine","Ix":5,"Type":"DINT","Var":""},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"Id_User","Ix":6,"Type":"DINT","Var":""},{"__type":"PF","Arg":"Enable"},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"Intervention","Ix":7,"Type":"BOOL","Var":"intervention"},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"MachineRestart","Ix":8,"Type":"BOOL","Var":"restart"}],"Ix":11,"Name":"Histo_Manager_Alarms","Out":[{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"MyDB","IO":true,"Ix":9,"Type":"OBJ\\DB\\BASE","Var":"DB_Machine"},{"__type":"PRM","Arg":"MyDB_General","IO":true,"Ix":10,"Type":"OBJ\\DB\\BASE","Var":"DB_General"},{"__type":"PF","Arg":"ENO"}],"UD":true,"X":1,"Var":"managerAlarms"}],"CMT":"It have two dependency \u000d\u000a\u000d\u000aThe production manager :\u000d\u000a- To get the work order of the production (by Id)\u000d\u000a- To get the reference of the product (by Id)\u000d\u000a- To get the current machine (by Id)\u000d\u000a\u000d\u000aThe user manager :\u000d\u000a- To get the user (by Id)","LRI":12,"RRI":13,"VLs":[]}
