{"CLs":[{"__type":"LD","Var":"HistoAlarm.Cmd.UpdateText"},{"__type":"ST","Ix":1,"Var":"Info_Struct","X":1}],"CMT":"The conversion of the text in Id occured only one time after the first connection! \u000d\u000a\u000d\u000aIf the bloc don't have IDs, it will make a request to the manager to get the id of the message\/group. If the manager find it,\u000d\u000ait will sent the id to the instance, or create a new line in the DB. All IDs are retained.\u000d\u000a\u000d\u000aSo changing the text will be not change the id, but you can ask the manager the reset every ID to make an update with this\u000d\u000acommand: HistoAlarm.Cmd.UpdateText","LRI":2,"RRI":3,"VLs":[]}
